  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero projectile count gains
    1 per talent per active Morning Bells bond LEVEL, capped at +3 total from this
    talent. Requires a projectile attack; final projectile limits still apply.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Bullet speed: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nRaised in an orchard lit by artificial suns, they followed
    moonlight through a broken roof. They return each season to describe the outside.
    Their family has begun cutting windows, and they want to see the first one open.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing
    modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: orchard,
    morning, rune. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
